        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Vichuku verekaieghe mashariki ya Jordani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu wa kivalwa cha Reubeni na cha Gadi, werekoghe na izungu ibaa ja mfugho; nawo werezighanireghe wikawona angu isanga ja Jazeri na isanga ja Gileadi jafwane kwa mfugho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko wikamghendia Musa na mkohani Eleazari, na vilongozi va wandu wikawizera, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Isanga ja Atarothi, Diboni, Jazeri, Nimra, Heshboni, Eleale, Sebamu, Nebo, na Beoni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ijo isanga BWANA orejikabieghe imbiri ya izungu ja wandu wa Israeli, ni isanga ja mfugho; na isi wadumiki wako deko na mfugho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikachuria kughamba, “Mkawona nicha dalomba isi wadumiki wenyu dineko ijo isanga dijiwuse; msakediruwusa Jordani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Musa ukawizera kivalwa cha Gadi na cha Reubeni, “Wanyinyu wighende wudenyii, nao inyo msigharike aeni aha? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwaki mkunde kubwagha wandu wa Israeli ngolo wiseghende isanga BWANA uwinekie? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nechi huwo niko koni weke ndeyo werebonyereghe, iji nerewidumieghe wiendejizighana isanga kufuma Kadesh-barnea.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.13.17+NUM.13.18+NUM.13.19+NUM.13.20+NUM.13.21+NUM.13.22+NUM.13.23+NUM.13.24+NUM.13.25+NUM.13.26+NUM.13.27+NUM.13.28+NUM.13.29+NUM.13.30+NUM.13.31+NUM.13.32+NUM.13.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mit. 13.17-33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa kukaia wiendavika Vololo ya Eshkoli, na kujiwona isanga, weewuya na kuwibwagha wandu wa Israeli ngolo wiseghende isanga BWANA uwinekie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na BWANA ukajokwa ni machu ijo ituku, hata ukaghema ukighamba,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.14.26+NUM.14.27+NUM.14.28+NUM.14.29+NUM.14.30+NUM.14.31+NUM.14.32+NUM.14.33+NUM.14.34+NUM.14.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mit. 14.26-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Loli cheni ndekuwadie mndungi wa awandu werejokieghe kufuma Misri wa irika ja miaka mirongo iwi na kuchumba uchaajiwona ijo isanga nerelaghirieghe kukaia nichawineka Abrahamu, Isaaka, na Jakobo; angu wiseninughie nicha.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndekuwadie mndungi, ela Kalebu mwana wa Jefune, uo Mkenizi, na Joshua mwana wa Nuni; angu awo weremnughieghe BWANA nicha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na BWANA ukajokwa ni machu aighu ya wandu wa Israeli, na kuwibonya wimare-mare kireti miaka mirongo ina, hata icho kivalwa chose cherebonyereghe mawiwi, chikasia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Idana wonenyi nenyo mwawuka wulalo ghwa weke ndeyo, kivalwa cha wandu wa kaung'a; mpate kughichuria agho machu ghibirie gha BWANA aighu ya Israeli! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu mkasigha kumnugha, nao moni uchawida kireti sena, nenyo mchatotesha awandu wose.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko wikasoghoda kaavui na Musa wikaghamba, “Dichaagha maranu gha ng'ondi aha kwa wundu ghwa ng'ondi redu, na mizi kwa wundu ghwa wana wedu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ela dichawada maswagha, dike tayari kikiria imbiri ya wandu wa Israeli, hata diwivikishe andu kwawo. Na wana wedu wichakaia andenyi ya mizi ya ngome, wisechesumbulwa ni wandu wa aha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndedichaawuya mizinyi mzedu, hata wandu wa Israeli wose wameria kupata kula mundu ifwa jake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu isi ndediendapata ifwa jingi nawo ija chia cha Jordani na noko kimonu anduangi; kwa kukaia dameria kupata ifwa jedu iichia cha mashariki ya Jordani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Musa ukawizera, “Mkabonya huwo, mmbwade maswagha na kughenda wudenyi imbiri ya BWANA, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na kula umu onyu uruwuke Jordani urwae maswagha ukilongozwa ni BWANA, hata BWANA umerie kuwiwinga wamaiza wake imbiri yake, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na kujiwada isanga; aho niko mchaawuya na kukaia huru, mselawilwagha ilagho jingi ni BWANA, hata wandu wa Israeli; na isanga iji jichakaia ifwa jenyu mwanekwa ni BWANA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela mkalegha huwo, mwameria kum'bonyera BWANA kaung'a; nenyo mkaie na loli kukaia kaung'a ichamfunya shighadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aghenyi mizi kwa wundu ghwa wana wenyu, na maranu kwa wundu ghwa ng'ondi renyu; nao m'bonye sa iji koni mwalaghira.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbari ya Gadi na mbari ya Reubeni wikamzera Musa, “Isi wadumiki wako dichabonya sa iji koni oho bwana odu kwalaghira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wana wedu, waka wedu, ng'ondi redu na ng'ombe redu rose, richasigharika aja mizinyi ya Gileadi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ela isi wadumiki wako dichakiria dikilongozwa ni BWANA dirwae maswagha, dighende wudenyi sa iji kwalaghira bwana odu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Musa ukafunya malaghiro aighu yawo kwa mkohani Eleazari, na kwa Joshua mwana wa Nuni, na kwa wabaa wa nyumba ra vichuku va wandu wa wandu wa Israeli;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.1.12+JOS.1.13+JOS.1.14+JOS.1.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jos. 1.12-15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ukaghamba, “Wandu wa kivalwa cha Gadi na cha Reubeni, wikaruwukanya nenyo Jordani wirwae maswagha wikilongozwa ni BWANA, na kujiwada isanga mkwanye, aho muwineke isanga ja Gileadi jikaie ifwa jawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela wikalegha kuruwuka chiaimweri, wirwae maswagha, wichapata ifwa aghadi konyu andenyi ya isanga ja Kanaani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu wa kivalwa cha Gadi, na cha Reubeni wikatumbulia, “Isi wadumiki wako dichabonya sa iji koni BWANA wadizera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dicharuwuka dirwae maswagha dikilongozwa ni BWANA, dingie isanga ja Kanaani; ela ifwa jedu jichasigharika Jordani nakimonu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko aho Musa ukawineka wandu wa kivalwa cha Gadi, na cha Reubeni, na nusu ya wandu wa kivalwa Manase mwana wa Josefu isanga ja Sihoni mzuri wa Waamori, na isanga ja Ogu mzuri wa Bashani chiaimweri na mizi yaro isangenyi kose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu wa kivalwa cha Gadi wikaagha mizi ya ngome na maranu gha ng'ondi aho Diboni, Atarothi, Aroeri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atiroth-shofani, Jazeri, Jogubeha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beth-nimra, na Beth-harani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na wandu wa kivalwa cha Reubeni wikaagha Heshboni, Eleale, Kiriathaimu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebo, Baal-meoni (marina gharo ghecheeghaluswa), na Sibma; na iyo mizi wereiaghieghe, wikaineka marina mazima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na wandu wa kivalwa cha Makiri mwana wa Manase, wikaghenda wikawada isanga ja Gileadi, wikawisoka Waamoni awo werekoghe andenyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa ukawineka wandu wa kivalwa cha Makiri mwana wa Manase isanga ja Gileadi wikajikaia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Jairi wa kivalwa cha Manase, ukaghenda ukawada mizi yawo mitini-mitini, ukaiwanga Havoth-jairi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Noba ukaghenda ukawada Kenathi na mizi yaro mitini-mitini; ukaiwanga Noba kunughana na irina jake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
